Package: inspercidados
Title: Access to Datasets from Insper Cidades
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Vinicius", "Oike", , "viniciusor@insper.edu.br", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8015-9189")),
    person("Insper Cidades", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: A lightweight interface for discovering, downloading, and citing
    datasets from Insper Cidades, hosted on Insper's Dataverse repository.
    Lists datasets and their logical resources, downloads data directly into
    R, links each dataset to its replication project, and generates academic
    citations from repository metadata.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/inspercidades/inspercidados,
    https://inspercidades.github.io/inspercidados
